@startuml SEQ_06_Completion_Escrow_Release
title Sequence 6 — Task Completion & Escrow Release

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #888

actor       "Student"               as ST
actor       "Household"             as HH
participant "Mobile App (Student)"  as AppS
participant "Mobile App (HH)"       as AppH
participant "TaskAPI"               as API
participant "Task Model"            as TM
participant "TaskCompletion Model"  as TC
participant "RefundService"         as RS
participant "Transaction Model"     as TX
participant "TransactionLedger"     as TL
participant "MpesaGateway"          as MP
participant "NotificationService"   as NS
database    "PostgreSQL"            as DB

== Student Marks Job Complete ==

ST   -> AppS  : Upload after-photo\nTap "Mark as Complete"
AppS -> API   : POST /tasks/{T}/student-complete/\n{after_photo: <file>}

API  -> TM    : task = get(id=T)\nassert task.status == InProgress
TM   -> DB    : SELECT tasks_task WHERE id=T
DB  --> TM    : task row

API  -> TC    : completion.finished_at = now()\ncompletion.after_photo = file
TC   -> DB    : UPDATE tasks_taskcompletion

API  -> TM    : task.status = AwaitingConfirmation\ntask.confirmation_deadline\n  = now() + 48h
TM   -> DB    : UPDATE tasks_task\nSET status='AwaitingConfirmation',\nconfirmation_deadline=…

API  -> NS    : send(\n  recipient=HH,\n  type=AWAITING_CONFIRMATION,\n  title="Student says job is done",\n  message="Confirm within 48 hours"\n)
NS   -> DB    : INSERT notification

API --> AppS  : 200 OK {task_status: AwaitingConfirmation}
AppS --> ST   : "Job marked complete.\nWaiting for household confirmation."

== Household Confirms Completion ==

HH   -> AppH  : Review after-photo\nTap "Confirm Completion"
AppH -> API   : POST /tasks/{T}/confirm-completion/

API  -> TM    : assert task.status == AwaitingConfirmation\nassert now() <= confirmation_deadline
TM   -> DB    : SELECT tasks_task WHERE id=T
DB  --> TM    : task row

API  -> TM    : task.status = Completed
TM   -> DB    : UPDATE tasks_task SET status='Completed'

== Escrow Release ==

API  -> RS    : release_to_student(task=T)

RS   -> TX    : transaction = Transaction.objects.get(task=T)
TX   -> DB    : SELECT payments_transaction WHERE task=T
DB  --> TX    : transaction (status=Held, amount=X)

RS   -> MP    : disburse_to_student(\n  student_phone=task.assigned_student.phone,\n  amount=transaction.amount\n)
MP  --> RS    : {mpesa_reference: "MP_REF_XYZ", success: true}

RS   -> TX    : transaction.status = Released\ntransaction.mpesa_reference = "MP_REF_XYZ"
TX   -> DB    : UPDATE payments_transaction SET status='Released'

RS   -> TL    : TransactionLedger.record(\n  task=T,\n  amount=transaction.amount,\n  type=RELEASE,\n  status=COMPLETED,\n  mpesa_reference="MP_REF_XYZ",\n  idempotency_key=uuid4()\n)
TL   -> DB    : INSERT INTO payments_transactionledger
DB  --> TL    : ledger row saved

RS  --> API   : {released: true, amount: X}

== Post-Completion Notifications ==

API  -> NS    : send(\n  recipient=ST,\n  type=PAYMENT_RELEASED,\n  title="Payment sent!",\n  message="KES {amount} sent to your M-Pesa"\n)
NS   -> DB    : INSERT notification

API  -> NS    : send(\n  recipient=HH,\n  type=TASK_COMPLETED,\n  title="Task completed",\n  message="Funds released to student"\n)
NS   -> DB    : INSERT notification

API --> AppH  : 200 OK {task_status: Completed}
AppH --> HH   : "Task complete! Please rate the student."

note over ST, HH
  Both parties are subsequently prompted
  to leave a Rating (1–5 ★ + comment).
  Ratings stored in payments_rating.
end note

== Auto-Confirm Fallback (48h deadline) ==

note over API, DB
  A scheduled job checks AwaitingConfirmation tasks
  where now() > confirmation_deadline.
  It auto-confirms and triggers the same release flow
  if the household has not responded within 48 hours.
end note

@enduml
